   "id": "el-0002",
   "seed": 581910391,
   "versionNonce": 881736089,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 48.12,
   "width": 2400,
   "height": 84.0,
   "strokeColor": "#6c757d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "KALT / SS Commercial Refrigeration.   https://ss-refrigeration.vercel.app   \u2014   live and public.\nThis canvas draws only what is deployed. The Phase 1 roadmap \u2014 R2, QStash, WhatsApp, the admin \u2014 is ss-refrigeration-free-tier, which by design contains components that do not exist yet; this one does not. The Phase 2-3 target canvas (Kafka, OpenSearch, multi-AZ) was deleted on 2026-10-12:\nits triggers have not fired and the picture was being read as the plan. HLD.md keeps the reasoning.\nOpen faults and their fixes: docs/ops/REMEDIATION-PLAN.md",
   "originalText": "KALT / SS Commercial Refrigeration.   https://ss-refrigeration.vercel.app   \u2014   live and public.\nThis canvas draws only what is deployed. The Phase 1 roadmap \u2014 R2, QStash, WhatsApp, the admin \u2014 is ss-refrigeration-free-tier, which by design contains components that do not exist yet; this one does not. The Phase 2-3 target canvas (Kafka, OpenSearch, multi-AZ) was deleted on 2026-10-12:\nits triggers have not fired and the picture was being read as the plan. HLD.md keeps the reasoning.\nOpen faults and their fixes: docs/ops/REMEDIATION-PLAN.md",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.4,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 12.0
  },
