   "strokeColor": "#6c757d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "22 routes. Every page sets revalidate = false, so nothing regenerates on a timer and the database sleeps between deploys. This is HLD-FREE-TIER \u00a74.1 enforced, and it is the decision that keeps the Neon compute budget intact.",
   "originalText": "22 routes. Every page sets revalidate = false, so nothing regenerates on a timer and the database sleeps between deploys. This is HLD-FREE-TIER \u00a74.1 enforced, and it is the decision that keeps the Neon compute budget intact.",
