   "height": 19.599999999999998,
   "strokeColor": "#6c757d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "src/modules/* are the seams; each exposes only index.ts and an ESLint rule enforces it. src/lib/container.ts is the composition root \u2014 it reads the capability flags in env.ts and wires a real adapter or deregisters the channel. That is why a missing token degrades one feature instead of breaking the lead path.",
   "originalText": "src/modules/* are the seams; each exposes only index.ts and an ESLint rule enforces it. src/lib/container.ts is the composition root \u2014 it reads the capability flags in env.ts and wires a real adapter or deregisters the channel. That is why a missing token degrades one feature instead of breaking the lead path.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.4,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 11.200000000000001
  },
