   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "QStash schedule: NOT BUILT\nNightly forced sweep: BUILT\n\nSo an event waits up to 24 h\ninstead of 15 min \u2014 and then\nfinds no notification channel\nconfigured, so it cannot be\npublished at all.",
