   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "HLD-FREE-TIER \u00a74.3 calls the\nnightly pg_dump to R2 \"the\nsingle most important cron\njob in the system\".\n\nIt is not built. No R2 bucket\nexists. Neon Free keeps a\n6 h history window and takes\nno scheduled backup.",
